#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Writes build/inappads-evidence/evidence.json (never committed): for every hook each module installs (extracted from its Module.m), the public source of the runtime
interface (class-dump header or maintained open-source tweak), its date, and what it shows. A hook with no source says so. Evidence of an
interface is NOT evidence that removing it removes ads in a given app version: `device_verified` stays empty until a device run records it.
Usage: generate-inappads-evidence.py [--check]"""
